      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5bafbca9282d5d55fb6899f8|full_name}: Right? and having more joinable friends worlds on the friends list would encourage people to play more i think. I can't count how many times i've heard people complain \"man, everyone is in a private instance\" and they don't feel like sending requests.",
