  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-05-03T04:46:46.638Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like an instance type that allows only friends of the host, and friends of the host's friends.\nThe main issue a lot of people have with Friends+ rooms is the infinitely chaining friends of friends of friends of friends..... etc that come into the room, turning the room into a lot of strangers that some people just don't want to deal with.\nI think this type of joinable instance would be much more popular than friends only or friends+, and would have people join each other's worlds more often by creating less private instances to avoid friends+.",
